WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.766
Your tools, finally working together.

2
00:00:03.948 --> 00:00:10.330
Every automation starts with one event: a form, a finished job, or a quote that's gone quiet.

3
00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:13.711
A new lead lands in your CRM, and you get a text.

4
00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:19.008
A finished job sends a review request, adds photos to your gallery and creates the invoice.

5
00:00:19.108 --> 00:00:23.153
A quiet quote gets a polite follow-up, unless they've already booked.

6
00:00:23.253 --> 00:00:27.903
Every run is logged, and anything that fails shows up the same day.

7
00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:32.130
Knight Logics. Book a call at knightlogics.com.

